          "message": {
            "text": "GET /rest/user/change-password: Sensitive data written to logs, supported by source analysis [confirmed_vulnerability]. The supplied source and logging-specific assessment establish that credential or personal-data content reaches log output without effective redaction. Remove it from the log or log a non-revealing fact instead. Logging evidence: request query field current reaches credential evidence \"security.hash(currentPassword) !== loggedInUser.data.password\" and the URL with its query string is recorded by request logging ('combined'); request query field new reaches credential evidence \"password: newPasswordInString\" and the URL with its query string is recorded by request logging ('combined'). Assessed logging exposure: vulnerable (data class credential, content yes, redaction no). Verified logger binding and source evidence, with consistent answers that sensitive content reaches the log without redaction; this is a static judgment, not runtime confirmation."
          },
