              "recommendations": {
                "title": "Keep credentials out of URLs and access logs",
                "actions": [
                  "Change the observed operation at server.ts:366: app.use(morgan('combined', { stream: accessLogStream }))",
                  "Remediate established vulnerabilities and poor practice. For Review items, resolve the named evidence before deciding whether or how behavior needs to change.",
                  "Move the credential from the URL query string to the request body (for example change GET to POST) and update every client that calls the route.",
