          "message": {
            "text": "GET /rest/track-order/:id: NoSQL injection supported by source analysis [confirmed_vulnerability]. The supplied source and injection-specific assessment establish that request input can affect query syntax or selector structure in the stated analysis scope. Remediate the injection using the verified database API; the underlying construction-practice concern is included in this one finding. Assessed injection/use protection: insufficient. Source-backed injection claim has required source, binding and path evidence, no declared blockers, and an independent injection-specific insufficient-protection assessment; this is a static judgment, not runtime confirmation."
